  "body": "Opportunities like this are rare and they don't last. The vendors are motivated, the price has been reduced, and this spectacular East Auckland cliff top property is seriously for sale.\r\n\r\nPositioned proudly above the water's edge on a prized Bucklands Beach site, this is more than just a home it's a front-row seat to the ocean. Here, the sea is not simply a view, but part of your daily rhythm. From the kitchen, living, dining, and expansive entertainer's deck, breathtaking uninterrupted views stretch endlessly across the water, delivering an ever-changing seascape you'll never tire of.\r\n\r\nWhat truly sets this property apart is that the hard work has already been done.\r\n\r\nThe land has undergone substantial geotechnical stabilisation, including a newly completed 22 metre deep concrete and steel retaining system. Designed, engineered, and constructed to an exceptional standard, this significant investment provides structural integrity and long-term peace of mind. \r\n\r\nCliff top positions are always special and few offer this level of engineered assurance. The existing three-bedroom home is light-filled, modern, and entirely liveable. Open-\r\nplan living flows effortlessly through stacker doors to glass balustrade decking, creating refined indoor-outdoor living against a stunning coastal backdrop. A modern\r\nbathroom and separate laundry add to the home's functionality, allowing you to move in and enjoy immediately.\r\n\r\nFor those seeking to elevate the vision further, concept plans and renders are available upon request - showcasing the calibre of contemporary coastal residence this remarkable site can support. The platform is secure. The outlook is timeless. The next chapter is yours to shape.\r\n\r\nLocated in one of East Auckland's most tightly held coastal pockets, you are zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College. Enjoy easy access to Howick Golf Club, Musick Point Reserve, the vibrant cafés and acclaimed restaurants of Bucklands Beach, and convenient ferry\r\nconnections from Half Moon Bay.\r\n\r\nA home to enjoy today. A foundation secured for the future. A blue-chip coastal position with engineering to match its grandeur.\r\n\r\nCall now to arrange your private viewing.",
